(go/method LoadWideBits "LoadWideBits reads a wide bit-field: the n bits at bit pos of the bytes at a (little-endian, pos\ncounted from a's least significant bit), extended by t's signedness to t (queue 164).\n" ^Wide [^{:tag (* Mem)} m ^uint64 a ^uint pos ^uint n ^WType t]
